1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,040
(Leonard:)And you know that deep down inside,
Howard's a really nice guy.

2
00:00:04,203 --> 00:00:09,043
(Penny:)The problem isn't what's on the inside.
It's the creepy candy coating.

3
00:00:11,043 --> 00:00:13,253
(Leonard:)Will you at least think about it?

4
00:00:13,421 --> 00:00:14,961
Just as a favor to me?

5
00:00:16,382 --> 00:00:17,422
[SIGHS]

6
00:00:17,592 --> 00:00:21,512
The great thing about Ernie
was he never asked me for anything.

7
00:00:21,929 --> 00:00:24,639
(Penny:)He just gave.

8
00:00:26,517 --> 00:00:28,227
(Sheldon:)Got it. Got it. Got it.

9
00:00:28,394 --> 00:00:31,564
(Sheldon:)Got it. Got it. Got it.

10
00:00:31,898 --> 00:00:34,818
Betty and Veronica. Oh.

11
00:00:36,027 --> 00:00:39,317
(Stuart:)Hey, Sheldon, the new Green Lantern
figurine's coming in tomorrow.

12
00:00:39,489 --> 00:00:41,739
(Stuart:)-Want me to set one aside for you?
-Thank you.

13
00:00:41,908 --> 00:00:45,248
(Sheldon:)You just robbed me of the opportunity
to stumble upon the figurine...

14
00:00:45,411 --> 00:00:50,081
(Sheldon:)...and make the oh-so-satisfying journey
from discovery to desire to possession.

15
00:00:50,249 --> 00:00:52,539
(Stuart:)-All right, I won't.
-But I must have it.

16
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:55,090
(Stuart:)-Okay, I'll set one aside for you.
-Thank you.

17
00:00:55,630 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)I can buy all these things online.
I come here for the personal service.

